note: names of several words (made with let, keep, to, as, call, for each, every)
keep hourly rate as 150
let late fee be 25
set late fee to late fee plus hourly rate
add 5 to late fee
to add tax to amount:
    give back amount times 1.25
to show menu:
    say "menu"
show menu
add tax to late fee
say (add tax to 4) plus 1
count from 1 to 3 as session number:
    say session number
for each guest name in guests:
    say guest name
ask "?" and call the answer visitor name
say every guest name in guests followed by "!"
say late
